(text "V1.2 REAL FLAT INTEGRATION RX ONLY: U401 pin4 PDout is ONE ELECTRICAL NET with R901 pin1 via PLL_PDOUT_3STATE.\n+5V_PLL and VANA20_FILT are still separate EXTERNAL rails, LO1 CMOS and N bus EXTERNAL. VTUNE external to unbuilt VCO.\nJ401 and J901 are temporary test headers and NOT final production ports; not a compensated closed PLL. NO FAB / NO TX." (at 265 360 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35))) (uuid "5c01bcb6-faae-4e37-bf12-000000000002"))
